# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# x402 merchant configuration (testnet)
#
# Out of the box, src/merchant.ts runs a VERIFIED testnet corridor:
#   Base Sepolia USDC  →  Tempo (Moderato) pathUSD
# You only NEED to set USE_STUB_FACILITATOR and — for real settlement — DEST_ADDRESS.
# The corridor menu below is OPTIONAL: uncomment a pair to switch direction.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Settlement mode — the one value most users touch.
#   true  — local stub: full 402 → pay → 200 flow, no facilitator/gateway/funds (default)
#   false — settle through a real Atum x402 facilitator (needs a funded payer + DEST_ADDRESS below)
USE_STUB_FACILITATOR=true

# Your receiving address on the destination chain.
# Required only when USE_STUB_FACILITATOR=false.
DEST_ADDRESS=0xYourMerchantAddressHere


# ─── Corridor (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The merchant accepts payment on a SOURCE (network + token) and delivers on a
# DEST (network + token). The corridor's CONTRACT ADDRESSES (escrow, fulfillment
# proxy, reserver, releaser, and the verifier endpoint) are NOT set here — the
# merchant resolves them from the gateway's GET /defaults at startup, so they
# can't drift. (Verified: /defaults returns exactly those addresses.)
#
# To switch direction: uncomment ONE source pair AND ONE dest pair. Each value is
# a CAIP-2 network id + the bare token address, from the Atum asset catalog:
# https://docs.atumlabs.xyz/get-started/reference/supported-assets
#
# Only the verified Base <-> Tempo testnet corridor is listed (EVM only — this
# example signs with ethers + Permit2). Cross-chain to Tempo can settle slower
# than x402 confirms synchronously — see the README's settlement-timing warning.
#
# Leaving all commented uses the default: Base Sepolia USDC -> Tempo pathUSD.

# ── SOURCE — what the payer funds from ──
# Base Sepolia · USDC   (default)
# SOURCE_NETWORK=eip155:84532
# SOURCE_ASSET=0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e
# Tempo Moderato · pathUSD
# SOURCE_NETWORK=eip155:42431
# SOURCE_ASSET=0x20C0000000000000000000000000000000000000

# ── DEST — what the merchant receives ──
# Tempo Moderato · pathUSD   (default)
# DEST_NETWORK=eip155:42431
# DEST_ASSET=0x20C0000000000000000000000000000000000000
# Base Sepolia · USDC
# DEST_NETWORK=eip155:84532
# DEST_ASSET=0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e


# Everything else (amount, markup, deadlines, gateway/facilitator URLs) has
# working testnet defaults in src/merchant.ts. See the README to override them.
